  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pua3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pua3) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 200.208 depth occurred on Apr 22 2025 51km NW of Ureparapara Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -13.1186 longitude 167.1245. It impacted 119 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
